{
  "movie_id": 220600101,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 3.5,
      "end_time": 6.1,
      "text": "Woooow! Yeaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 7.3,
      "end_time": 9.6,
      "text": "Wow..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 12.2,
      "end_time": 14.1,
      "text": "Let's dig in!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 14.3,
      "end_time": 17.5,
      "text": "**munch* *munch** (Delicious!) This is pretty good!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 17.7,
      "end_time": 20.5,
      "text": "My Lord, you got sauce on your face."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 21.1,
      "end_time": 22.0,
      "text": "Thank you..."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 22.2,
      "end_time": 23.5,
      "text": "Aah!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 24.4,
      "end_time": 25.2,
      "text": "Water!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 26.3,
      "end_time": 27.6,
      "text": "Would you like some?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 31.5,
      "end_time": 34.1,
      "text": "Stop it! *munch*!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 34.3,
      "end_time": 37.0,
      "text": "Right? It's delicious, isn't it? Here, here, here~"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 37.2,
      "end_time": 38.6,
      "text": "*munch*"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 39.0,
      "end_time": 40.0,
      "text": "Then...."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 42.1,
      "end_time": 43.5,
      "text": "Once again,"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 44.2,
      "end_time": 47.1,
      "text": "The Knight of Landosol and his companions"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 47.3,
      "end_time": 49.3,
      "text": "On behalf of Gio Gehenna"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 49.6,
      "end_time": 53.9,
      "text": "I, Princess Nephi Nela, humbly offer my thanks."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 54.4,
      "end_time": 57.0,
      "text": "Well then, the feast is in full swing."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 57.2,
      "end_time": 60.2,
      "text": "Let's feast as promised."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 61.1,
      "end_time": 62.9,
      "text": "Finest──"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 63.3,
      "end_time": 64.6,
      "text": "Grilled Chicken!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 65.1,
      "end_time": 66.6,
      "text": "Nooo!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 67.1,
      "end_time": 70.0,
      "text": "I'm sooooooooorryyyyyyyーー!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 70.5,
      "end_time": 71.8,
      "text": "Stoppppp"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 72.0,
      "end_time": 73.6,
      "text": "Wait, Nela-san!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 74.2,
      "end_time": 78.6,
      "text": "The current Miss Ho-oh is in the same form as us."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 79.2,
      "end_time": 80.6,
      "text": "I can't just eat her..."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 85.1,
      "end_time": 86.3,
      "text": "*drool*..."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 86.6,
      "end_time": 88.4,
      "text": "You guys..."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 88.6,
      "end_time": 90.9,
      "text": "Forgive meeee~~!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 91.1,
      "end_time": 94.2,
      "text": "──Hmm. Well, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 95.3,
      "end_time": 96.6,
      "text": "U-uuuuu"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 97.3,
      "end_time": 99.0,
      "text": "Baaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 99.3,
      "end_time": 103.4,
      "text": "Thank you so much! Knight-san~!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 108.2,
      "end_time": 110.6,
      "text": "──Hmph. What a noisy bunch."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 111.2,
      "end_time": 113.3,
      "text": "These people without manners..."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 116.2,
      "end_time": 117.2,
      "text": "──That's right."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 117.5,
      "end_time": 122.6,
      "text": "Before we forget, let's give Kishi-dono a reward."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 123.5,
      "end_time": 129.3,
      "text": "In the unfamiliar Gio Gehenna,\nyou need a guide."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 130.2,
      "end_time": 131.6,
      "text": "That would be helpful"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 132.2,
      "end_time": 136.0,
      "text": "So, does that mean you’re giving them a person as a reward?"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start_time": 136.4,
      "end_time": 137.3,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start_time": 137.5,
      "end_time": 139.0,
      "text": "Which one?"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start_time": 139.5,
      "end_time": 143.5,
      "text": "Exactly. There's someone suitable here."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start_time": 144.2,
      "end_time": 146.6,
      "text": "──Well? Kanon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start_time": 148.2,
      "end_time": 149.0,
      "text": "Huh?"
    }
  ],
